        "testimonial_J4KxCC": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Priya Sharma",
            "text": "<p>I'd been feeling tired for months, but regular tests showed 'normal.' AIWO 181 found severely low B12 and vitamin D that others missed. The nutritionist explained how these affected my energy and mood. Three months later, I feel like a completely different person.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_mDNQRF": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Rajesh Kumar",
            "text": "<p>Working 12-hour days, I thought exhaustion was normal. AIWO 181 revealed early insulin resistance and high cortisol. They didn't just give numbers - they explained what it meant for my future health. Now I'm taking preventive steps against diabetes risk.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_BYX7YM": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Meera Patel",
            "text": "<p>Even being health-conscious, AIWO 181 showed me things I never knew to check - like hormone levels. My low testosterone explained slow workout recovery. Their personalized supplement plan actually works. Better results in 2 months than the previous year.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_YqTdmw": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Dr. Suresh Nair",
            "text": "<p>As a doctor, I was impressed by the comprehensive biomarkers they test, like Lipoprotein(a) and homocysteine. The report revealed my genetic heart disease predisposition. I now recommend this test to patients who want to be proactive about their health.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_38rzhh": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Anjali Gupta",
            "text": "<p>Between work and two kids, I had no time for health. Home collection was so convenient. The report revealed low iron and borderline thyroid function. The nutritionist gave practical meal advice that fits my busy schedule. Six months later, I have more energy than in years.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        }
